Body:
For anyone using custom providers do this:
```
"provider": {
    "custom-deepseek": {
      "models": {
        "deepseek-v4-pro": {
          "interleaved": {
            "field": "reasoning_content",
          },
        },
      },
    },
  },
```

I'll configure stuff to default it to set this for deepseek models but for now you need to follow this as mentioned in many issues and many prs (@yujf @Meepoljdx)

> How are you configuring it? Show me your opencode.json it seems like you have custom provider你是怎么配置的？给我看看你的 opencode.json 看起来你用的是自定义供应商

```
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "provider": {
    "glm": {
      "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",
      "options": {
        "baseURL": "https://www.papaclaoud.top/v1",
        "apiKey": "***",
        "setCacheKey": true
      },
      "models": {
        "deepseek-v4-pro": {
          "name": "deepseek-v4-pro"
        },
        "kimi-k2.6": {
          "name": "kimi-k2.6"
        },
        "minimax-m2.7": {
          "name": "minimax-m2.7"
        },
        "doubao-seed-2.0-pro": {
          "name": "doubao-seed-2.0-pro"
        },
        "glm-5.1": {
          "name": "glm-5.1"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "mcp": {
    "Excel": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": [
        "npx",
        "--yes",
        "@negokaz/excel-mcp-server"
      ],
      "environment": {
        "EXCEL_MCP_PAGING_CELLS_LIMIT": "400000"
      },
      "enabled": true
    },
    "MySQL": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": [
        "uvx",
        "--from",
        "mysql-mcp-server",
        "mysql_mcp_server"
      ],
      "environment": {
        "MYSQL_DATABASE": "",
        "MYSQL_HOST": "",
        "MYSQL_PASSWORD": "",
        "MYSQL_PORT": "",
        "MYSQL_USER": ""
      },
      "enabled": true
    },
    "Time": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": [
        "uvx",
        "mcp-server-time",
        "--local-timezone=Asia/Shanghai"
      ],
      "enabled": true
    },
    "context7": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": [
        "npx",
        "-y",
        "@upstash/context7-mcp@latest"
      ],
      "enabled": true
    }
  }
}
```

error：The `content[].thinking` in the thinking mode must be passed back to the API.

@tianheng2017 do this:
```
"models": {
        "deepseek-v4-pro": {
          "name": "deepseek-v4-pro",
          "interleaved": { "field": "reasoning_content" }
        },
```
